	(text_box "Assume 50% CTR w.c.\nVf = 1.2V @1mA\nVf2 ~ 0.7V @1mA\nLowest battery = 10V\n\nCircuit CTR:\nIf = (10V-1.2V-0.7V)/1mA = 8k1 \nClosest 8k2 => 0.987mA\nIc = 3.3/10k = 330uA\nCTRc = 0.33/0.987 = 33.43%\n\nOpto is always in saturation\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
